* ''Same-face tabs share one provider'' (operator, 2026-11-06, approving the house's defaults). One Keyhive provider per face lights at that face's first unlock; each later tab proves its own unlock; the face's last session closing drains in-flight verification, then drops the provider and its keys. Carriers: <<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/k19-hive-lane#/the-slices`>>, and `pono/browser-vessel-lift`, carried by the b1 lanes' carriers at their land.

